<title>FINLAND: SANTASALO SEES RISING 97 PROFITS AND SALES.</title>
<headline>SANTASALO SEES RISING 97 PROFITS AND SALES.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish engineering group Santasalo-JOT Oy said in a statement on Monday it expected profits and net sales to increase this year compared to 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;Net sales for the Santasalo-JOT group should rise to 900 million markka for the whole of 1997 and profits should rise on the previous year,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>In 1996, group profit after financial items rose 50 percent to 37.9 million markka. Net sales rose to 846 million markka from 792 million.  </p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
</text>
